# Public read-only F&B sharing is provided by physical HTML files using
# Cloudflare Pages clean URLs:
#   /share/fnb.html -> /share/fnb
#   /share/fnb/<slug>.html -> /share/fnb/<slug>
# No rewrite is used, so the initial HTTP response is the crawler-ready HTML.

# SPA fallback, one line per authenticated route or compatibility alias.
#
# The target MUST be "/" and not "/index.html": Cloudflare Pages canonicalises
# /index.html to / with a 308, so a rewrite pointing at /index.html stops being
# a rewrite and becomes a real redirect. The SPA then loses the requested path
# before its JavaScript runs.
#
# These MUST stay explicit. A catch-all ("/* / 200") shadows static assets.
/fnb / 200
/brand / 200
/ihg-history / 200
/hotel-factsheet / 200
/messages / 200
/settings / 200
/account / 200
/admin / 200
